  "name": "Test · Warm Matte",
  "description": "A soft, warm, matte look for testing styles: lower contrast with lifted blacks, recovered highlights, toned-down greens, warm highlights and cool shadows, a light vignette. Auto exposure evens out differently exposed photos (against the group when applied with 'even out'); white balance stays the camera's, 400 K warmer.",
